 tempo capace di abbattere le barriere dimensionali, che per funzionare ha bisogno continuamente di corrente elettrica."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"His high school teacher issues an ultimatum: turn in a science project or flunk. So Mike Harlan scavenges a military base's junk pile for a suitable gizmo. He finds one... and unwittingly unleashes the awesome power and energy of the unknown. Twisted dimensions. Time warps. A fantastic realm where the past, present, and future collide in a whirling vortex of startling adventure and superlative special effects.","tagline":"We must not destroy the world."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9gce0dT47QbPZWAWF958829FfsQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2KDfY3QCRz23Xdi21Ey6ATa7Oe8.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":18252,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9gce0dT47QbPZWAWF958829FfsQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9gce0dT47QbPZWAWF958829FfsQ.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9gce0dT47QbPZWAWF958829FfsQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9gce0dT47QbPZWAWF958829FfsQ.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l2ieoIkyC0vrRXpjdBtWizim0LR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l2ieoIkyC0vrRXpjdBtWizim0LR.jpg","language":"it","width":658,"height":988}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1fbVPx5VVEsgJ7M9sTzvbDjhgks.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1fbVPx5VVEsgJ7M9sTzvbDjhgks.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p